<title>USA: CBOT soyoil deliveries - Sept 5.</title>
<headline>CBOT soyoil deliveries - Sept 5.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Delivery notices against the September soyoil for September 6 (In contracts).</p>
<p>SOYOIL - 1,931 lots. Oldest long - September 4, 1996.</p>
<p>Delivered - 1st option/c 87, combs/h 24, dorman/c 91, combs/c 43, term commodities/h 240, ing/c 126, smith barney/c 2, 1st option/c 299, 1st option/c 2, kenosha/h 392, 1st option/c 218, 1st option/h 406.</p>
<p>Received - 1st option/c 100, central/h 2, combs/h 1, dorman/c 75, combs/c 50, ING/c 130, 1st option/c 262, kenosha/h 465, tenco/c 1, 1st option/c 250, 1st option/c 483, ADM Investor Services/h 112.</p>
<p>H=house account. C=Customer Account.</p>
<p>Source: Chicago Board of Trade Clearing Corp.</p>
<p>(Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8720)</p>
